.Dd August 15, 2026
.Dt GLUEWC 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm gluewc
.Nd animated BSP Wayland compositor
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl d
.Op Fl s Ar command
.Nm
.Fl v
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a wlroots-based Wayland compositor with automatic binary-space-partition
tiling, fixed workspaces, modal controls, SceneFX effects and an animated
workspace overview.
.Pp
The recommended entry point is
.Nm gluewc-session
or the gluewc display-manager session.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl d
Enable verbose wlroots logging.
.It Fl s Ar command
Start
.Ar command
through a shell with the compositor.
Its process group receives
.Dv SIGTERM
when gluewc exits.
.It Fl v
Print the version and exit.
.El
.Sh CONFIGURATION
Runtime configuration is read from
.Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/gluewc/config.conf
or
.Pa ~/.config/gluewc/config.conf .
The installed session creates this file from
.Pa /usr/local/share/gluewc/config.def.conf
on first login.
.Pp
Appearance, XKB settings, autostart commands and bindings can be changed at
runtime.
Press Mod-Shift-R to reload the file in place.
Compiled defaults
remain in
.Pa config.h .
.Pp
A binding has the form:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
bind_insert = mod+Return = spawn:foot
bind_normal = h = wm:ratio:-0.05
.Ed
.Pp
See the project configuration guide and the installed default config for all
settings and actions.
.Sh DEFAULT BINDINGS
.Bl -tag -width 28n -compact
.It Mod tap
Toggle overview.
.It Mod-Return , Mod-Q
Start alacritty.
.It Mod-Space
Start rofi in application mode.
.It Mod-[1-9]
Select workspace 1 through 9.
.It Mod-Ctrl-[1-9]
Move the focused window to a workspace and follow it.
.It Mod-Arrow , Mod-[h/j/k/l]
Focus directionally.
Crossing the horizontal edge selects the adjacent
workspace.
.It Mod-Shift-Arrow
Swap the focused window directionally.
.It Mod-PageUp , Mod-PageDown
Select the previous or next workspace.
.It Mod-Ctrl-PageUp , Mod-Ctrl-PageDown
Move the focused window to the previous or next workspace.
.It Mod-F
Toggle fullscreen inside the panel-reserved usable area.
.It Mod-Shift-F
Toggle real output fullscreen.
.It Mod-V
Toggle centered floating.
.It Mod-B
Toggle window borders and gaps.
.It Mod-O
Toggle configured window opacity.
.It Mod-C
Close the focused window.
.It Mod-Escape
Enter normal mode.
.It Mod-Shift-R
Reload runtime configuration.
.It Mod-Shift-Q
Quit.
.El
.Ss Normal mode
Normal mode consumes keyboard input until
.Sy i
returns to insert mode.
Arrow keys and j/k focus windows, h/l adjust the
focused split ratio, H/L swap in tree order, and s toggles split direction.
.Ss Mouse
.Bl -tag -width 20n -compact
.It Mod-Button1
Move the focused window; tiled windows become floating.
.It Mod-Button2
Toggle floating.
.It Mod-Button3
Resize the focused window; tiled windows become floating.
.El
.Sh OVERVIEW AND GESTURES
The overview shows the current workspace and its two neighbors.
Use arrows,
workspace numbers, the wheel or a two-finger horizontal swipe to navigate.
Click a window to focus it or drag it between workspace cards.
.Pp
A three-finger horizontal swipe changes workspace.
A three-finger upward swipe opens the overview and a downward swipe closes it.
Mod-wheel changes
workspace from the desktop.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP
.It Ev XDG_RUNTIME_DIR
Directory used for the Wayland socket.
It must be set.
.It Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Base directory for the runtime config.
.It Ev XDG_STATE_HOME
Base directory used by
.Nm gluewc-session
for logs.
.It Ev WAYLAND_DISPLAY
Set by gluewc for child Wayland clients.
.It Ev DISPLAY
Set when the built-in XWayland server is ready.
.It Ev WLR_*
wlroots backend, renderer and diagnostic options.
.It Ev XKB_* , XCOMPOSEFILE , XCURSOR_PATH
Keyboard and cursor configuration used by the underlying libraries.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa ~/.config/gluewc/config.conf
Runtime configuration.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/gluewc.log
Current session log when started with gluewc-session.
.It Pa ~/.local/state/gluewc.log.old
Previous session log.
.It Pa /usr/share/wayland-sessions/gluewc.desktop
Display-manager session entry.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rofi 1 ,
.Xr waybar 5 ,
.Xr xkeyboard-config 7
